[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3096960155","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108824#issuecomment-3096960155","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108824","id":3096960155,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64l9yb","user":{"login":"Storm-Dev6","id":188445215,"node_id":"U_kgDOCztyHw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188445215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6","html_url":"https://github.com/Storm-Dev6","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T14:12:16Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T14:12:16Z","body":"Hi @LeftoverAtoms,\n\nThanks for reporting this — I can confirm that this issue also occurs on my system and it's definitely frustrating when reorganizing folders.\n\n🧩 Summary of the issue:\nWhen using \"Save to File\" for imported meshes:\n\nIf you rename or move a parent folder from within Godot's FileSystem panel,\n\nThe .import metadata does not update the saved mesh path,\n\nThe result: the mesh is \"broken\" and must be manually fixed in the .import file or by reimporting.\n\n💡 Additional Notes:\nThis is likely because the saved mesh path in .import files is absolute or project-relative, but not updated when the resource folder structure changes.\n\nThis can break the workflow especially for users who organize scenes or assets after the initial import.\n\n🔧 Possible Workaround (for now):\nAfter renaming folders, open the .import file associated with the broken mesh (e.g., yourmesh.glb.import),\n\nManually update the save_path to the correct new location of the .mesh file.\n\nThen reimport the asset.\n\n✅ Suggestion for Improvement:\nIt would be great if:\n\nGodot could automatically update the save_path in .import files when folders are moved or renamed inside the editor,\n\nOr at least warn users that \"Save to File\" assets may break on folder rename unless reimported or paths are manually adjusted.\n\nLet me know if you'd like help testing or reproducing this in a minimal project!\n\nBest regards, 👍 ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3096960155/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3100058373","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108824#issuecomment-3100058373","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108824","id":3100058373,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64xyMF","user":{"login":"LeftoverAtoms","id":66341882,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MzQxODgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66341882?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeftoverAtoms","html_url":"https://github.com/LeftoverAtoms","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeftoverAtoms/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeftoverAtoms/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeftoverAtoms/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeftoverAtoms/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeftoverAtoms/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeftoverAtoms/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeftoverAtoms/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeftoverAtoms/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeftoverAtoms/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-22T00:19:08Z","updated_at":"2025-07-22T00:19:08Z","body":"Currently one workaround is by using a UID instead. I'm not sure why Godot randomly put a UID there instead of a filepath but hey it works.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3100058373/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3131991881","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108824#issuecomment-3131991881","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108824","id":3131991881,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66rmdJ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/